{"sha": "3c7908e6d5ca013813dc64b87bfed50593c037a74ba37dcb5c1969658fb810a9", "body": ["\\chapter{减法}\\label{ch:g2:subtraction}", "", "当上面的个位不够减时，我们就拆开一个", "十 --- \\emph{借位}，它正是进位的逆过程。本章先用小棒讲解它，", "再训练笔算减法，", "并介绍一种简便的“往上数”方法。", "", "\\section{为什么要借位}", "", "\\begin{example}[拆开一个十]\\label{ex:g2:subtraction:unbundle}", "$42 - 17$：一共要拿走 $7$ 个一，可是只有 $2$ 个一，不够！", "于是把 $4$ 个十中的一个拆开，变成十个一，", "此时上面有 $3$ 个十和 $12$ 个一。拿走：$12 - 7 = 5$（个），并且", "$3 - 1 = 2$（十）。因此 $42 - 17 = 25$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.75]", "  % a tied ten...", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,9} \\draw[omExo, very thick]", "    (0.2*\\i,0) -- (0.2*\\i,1.7);", "  \\draw[omExo, thick, rounded corners=3pt]", "    (-0.2,0.62) rectangle (2.0,1.05);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0.9,-0.25) {一个十};", "  % ...untied into ten loose units", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (2.6,0.85) -- (3.6,0.85);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,9} \\draw[omDef, very thick]", "    (4.2+0.34*\\i,0) -- (4.2+0.34*\\i,1.7);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (5.73,-0.25) {十个一};", "  \\node[right, font=\\small, align=left] at (8.0,0.85)", "    {拆开一个十，凑出足够减的\\\\个一};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 借位就是拆开：一个十变成十个一，使得", "减法得以进行。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{笔算方法}", "", "\\begin{method}[竖式减法]\\label{met:g2:subtraction:column}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 把较大的数写在上面，个位对齐；", "  \\item 先减个位；若上面的数字不够减，就借一个", "        十，在本位变为十个一；", "  \\item 再减十位，然后减百位；", "  \\item \\emph{检验}：差加上减去的数，", "        必须得到上面的被减数。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g2:subtraction:worked}", "计算 $503 - 168$：", "\\[", "\\begin{array}{r}", "5\\,0\\,3 \\\\", "-\\ 1\\,6\\,8 \\\\", "\\hline", "3\\,3\\,5", "\\end{array}", "\\]", "个位：$3 - 8$ 不够减；十位上没有十可借，", "所以先从百位借：上面变为 $4$ 个百、", "$9$ 个十、$13$ 个一。然后 $13 - 8 = 5$；$9 - 6 = 3$；", "$4 - 1 = 3$。检验：$335 + 168 = 503$。\\checkmark", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{往上数}", "", "\\begin{method}[用往上数的方法减]\\label{met:g2:subtraction:countup}", "当两个数比较接近时，从小的数出发，", "一步步往上数到大的数，再把各次跳的数加起来：", "\\[", "83 - 78: \\quad 78 \\to 80 \\text{ 是 } 2, \\ 80 \\to 83 \\text{ 是 } 3,", "\\text{ 所以 } 83 - 78 = 5 .", "\\]", "两个数很接近时，往上数比借位更快，", "这正是售货员找零的方法。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (76.6,0) -- (84.4,0);", "  \\foreach \\i in {77,...,84} \\draw (\\i,-0.1) -- (\\i,0.1);", "  \\foreach \\i in {78,80,83}", "    \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (\\i,-0.12) {\\i};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (78,0.3) .. controls (79,0.9) ..", "    (80,0.3);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small] at (79,1.0) {$+2$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (80,0.3) .. controls (81.5,1.05) ..", "    (83,0.3);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (81.5,1.1) {$+3$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 用往上数求 $83 - 78$：两步，$2 + 3 = 5$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[找零]\\label{ex:g2:subtraction:change}", "一个玩具价钱是 $34$；你付了 $50$。找零时往上数，", "$34 \\to 40$ 是 $6$，$40 \\to 50$ 是 $10$，所以找零是 $16$。", "这正是售货员的做法：$50 - 34 = 16$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g2:subtraction:1}", "计算（不需要借位）：$58 - 23$；\\quad $176 - 45$；\\quad", "$389 - 164$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g2:subtraction:2}", "计算（需要借位）：$52 - 17$；\\quad $73 - 28$；\\quad", "$60 - 24$。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}